sequenceDiagram
    actor Resp as Responsable coopérative
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant SVC as PlotService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS

    Resp->>FE: Dessine/saisit le polygone (Leaflet)
    FE->>API: POST /api/plots {geojson, farmer_id, ...}
    API->>API: StorePlotRequest (validation GeoJSON, superficie > 0)
    API->>SVC: create(data)
    SVC->>DB: INSERT ... ST_GeomFromGeoJSON(...)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT ST_Area(geography(geom))
    DB-->>SVC: area_m2
    SVC-->>API: Plot (avec area_ha calculée)
    API-->>FE: 201 Created + PlotResource
    FE-->>Resp: Confirmation + affichage sur carte
